// Copy to Configs/Secrets.xcconfig (ignored by git) to switch the app from the fakes to the
// real Clerk sign-in and Convex backend. Both values must be set; with either one empty, the app
// stays on the fakes. Steps: docs/backend-switch.md.
//
// Neither value is a secret: the publishable key and the backend URL both ship inside the app.
// A Clerk SECRET key (sk_...) must never go here or anywhere in this repo; the app refuses one.

// Clerk dashboard → API keys → Publishable key (pk_test_... for the dev instance).
CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY = pk_test_REPLACE_ME

// The Convex deployment's HTTP actions URL (ends in .convex.site, not .convex.cloud).
// xcconfig files treat // as a comment, so the slashes are split with $().
NOOK_API_BASE_URL = https:/$()/beaming-oyster-905.convex.site
